00:06:24.216 --> 00:06:26.452
"Listen, nobody's
ever gonna want that.

00:06:26.519 --> 00:06:28.454
<i> Computers are for work.
 They're for science.</i>

00:06:28.521 --> 00:06:30.456
<i> They're not for people
 in their homes."</i>

00:06:30.523 --> 00:06:32.057
<i> Steve Jobs knew
 they were wrong.</i>

00:06:32.124 --> 00:06:35.494
And from there,
he just changed the entire game.

