drive in our computers."

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:00.392 align:start size:69% position:31%
We're like,
"No, what do you mean?
We need that."

00:11:00.459 --> 00:11:02.160 align:start position:0%
Apple is kind of known
for killing off ports

00:11:02.227 --> 00:11:03.295 align:start position:0%
they don't think
we need anymore.

