<i> some of the Macintosh's
 competitors firsthand,</i>

00:12:38.557 --> 00:12:41.860
<i> I want to know
 how did Apple take on
 its biggest threat,</i>

00:12:41.927 --> 00:12:44.229
<i> computer giant IBM?</i>

00:12:44.296 --> 00:12:47.566
Back then, Apple was still
