00:14:20.258 --> 00:14:21.392 line:0%
<i> ...Steve Jobs took the stage,</i>

00:14:21.459 --> 00:14:23.528 line:0%
<i> ready to unveil
 his latest creation</i>

00:14:23.595 --> 00:14:26.131 line:0%
